[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the motor electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Air intake actuator</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024545\">N82</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew the motor retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the motor (3a) releasing the intake (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2004834.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the motor is undamaged.</p><p>Position the motor engaging the intake\nin the compulsory position.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the motor.</p><p>Connect the motor electrical connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025795\">7040A09</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3025801\">7040A31</a></p>"]]